Syntax: pray 'heroes feast'

Heroes Feast is an advanced divine conjuration that summons a magnificent
spread of food and drink sufficient to feed an entire party of adventurers.
The prayer calls upon the deity's providence to materialize sustenance from
nothing, ensuring that the faithful need not go hungry in the wilderness.

The feast provides both food and water in generous quantities, making it
far more efficient than casting separate create food and create water
prayers. A single casting can satisfy the hunger and thirst of multiple
people.

While the divine provisions are perfectly nutritious and safe to consume,
they lack the flavor and variety of properly prepared meals. The food
appears somewhat bland and generic - functional sustenance rather than
culinary art. Most adventurers agree that a good tavern meal is preferable
when available.

See Also: CREATE FOOD, CREATE WATER
